@startuml F1.8-D05-rascunho
title F1.8-D05 — Salvar rascunho
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Aluno" as Aluno
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "OpenRequestController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Aluno -> WebApp: sai do wizard\n(dados parciais)
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /requests/draft
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: INSERT/UPDATE\nestado=RASCUNHO
Postgres --> Ctrl: OK
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200
note right of WebApp
  Cópia local opcional (PWA)
  Modal Continuar/Novo = client-side
end note

@enduml
